[15.647, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m \u001b[1mFolder to map (empty to finish)\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;8m\u00b7\u001b[0m \u001b[32m\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m[5/5]\u001b[0m \u001b[1mShell integration\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.649, "o", "\u001b[33m?\u001b[0m \u001b[1mRoute `claude` through claude-switcher? (adds a marked block to ~/.zshrc)\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;8m(y/n)\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;8m\u203a\u001b[0m \u001b[36myes\u001b[0m\u001b[?25l"]
[16.554, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m \u001b[1mRoute `claude` through claude-switcher? (adds a marked block to ~/.zshrc)\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;8m\u00b7\u001b[0m \u001b[32myes\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[?25h"]
[16.554, "o", "\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m Shell integration added to ~/.zshrc\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mYour profiles\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.555, "o", "personal  you@example.com                    (default, ~/.claude)\r\nwork      you@company.com                    \r\n\r\n\u001b[1"]
[16.555, "o", "mNext steps\u001b[0m\r\n  1. Open a new terminal, so `claude` goes through claude-switcher\r\n  2. Run claude in any project: it uses that folder's account, or asks once\r\n  3. "]
[16.555, "o", "Switch a project later with: csw   (check everything: csw doctor)\r\n"]
[16.558, "o", "\u001b]0;~\u0007"]
[16.558, "o", "\r\u001b[0m\u001b[27m\u001b[24m\u001b[J\u001b[38;5;245m~\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;173m$\u001b[39m \u001b[K\u001b[?2004h"]
